ิตสื่อและถ่ายทำภาพเคลื่อนไหว","en":"An independent group for people who love film: watching together, discussing them critically, and making and shooting their own."},"contacts":[{"value":"tpc.filmclub","channel":"instagram","_key":"0"}],"location":"$undefined","isActive":true},{"_id":"786cf6cf-6d83-4fad-9ef1-85f09c23fccb","_type":"organisation","_createdAt":"2026-10-23T16:10:32.086Z","_updatedAt":"2026-10-31T06:37:28.732Z","name":{"th":"ชุมนุม TPC Music","en":"TPC Music"},"slug":{"current":"tpc-music"},"type":"club","faculty":"$undefined","facultyId":"$undefined","scope":"$undefined","programmeName":"$undefined","description":{"th":"ชุมนุมเกี่ยวกับดนตรี เปิดพื้นที่ให้นักศึกษามหาวิทยาลัยธรรมศาสตร์ ท่าพระจันทร์ ที่รักในเสียงดนตรีได้มีส่วนร่วม","en":"A music club, open to any Thammasat Tha Prachan student who loves music."},"contacts":[{"value":"tpc.music","channel":"instagram","_key":"0"}],"location":"$undefined","isActive":true},{"_id":"357934d2-4d9c-40d1-a07a-8159ebff11d5","_type":"organisation","_createdAt":"2026-10-23T16:10:32.086Z","_updatedAt":"2026-10-31T06:37:28.732Z","name":{"th":"กลุ่มอิสระสารคดีศึกษาแห่งมหาวิทยาลัยธรรมศาสตร์","en":"TU Documentary"},"slug":{"current":"tu-documentary"},"type":"independentGroup","faculty":"$undefined","facultyId":"$undefined","scope":"$undefined","programmeName":"$undefined","description":{"th":"กลุ่มอิสระที่จัดทำสารคดีในรูปแบบของภาพถ่าย วิดีโอ และบทความ เพราะสิ่งเหล่านี้บอกเล่าความเป็นมาและเรื่องราวได้ดีที่สุด","en":"An independent group making documentaries as photography, video and writing, on the view that those tell a story best."},"contacts":[{"value":"tudocumentary","channel":"instagram","_key":"0"}],"location":"$undefined","isActive":true},{"_id":"bf2a079c-238e-497d-8e9e-e2bc30b671f6","_type":"organisation","_createdAt":"2026-10-23T16:10:32.086Z","_updatedAt":"2026-11-17T04:31:29.214Z","name":{"th":"ชุมนุมสื่อสร้างสรรค์","en":"TUHost"},"slug":{"current":"tu-host"},"type":"club","faculty":"$undefined","facultyId":"$und